layout: base.njk
eleventyComputed:
  title: "Agent SDKs — Harness Census"
---
<h1>Agent SDKs &amp; Frameworks</h1>
<p>General agent-building frameworks, SDKs, and toolkits. These ship no coding agent of their own — developers construct agents from them (AutoGen, CrewAI, LangGraph, and similar).</p>
<p>{{ collections["agent-sdk"] | size }} SDKs catalogued.</p>

<table class="agent-table">
  <thead>
    <tr><th>Name</th><th>Maker</th><th>License</th><th>Stars</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {% set sorted = collections["agent-sdk"] | sortByStars %}
    {% for sdk in sorted %}
    <tr>
      <td><a href="{{ ('/agents/' ~ sdk.data.slug ~ '/') | url }}">{{ sdk.data.name }}</a></td>
      <td>{{ sdk.data.maker or "—" }}</td>
      <td>{{ sdk.data.license or "—" }}</td>
      <td>{{ sdk.data.stars | starFmt }}</td>
    </tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
